WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.458
Hi there!

2
00:00:05.459 --> 00:00:07.865
Who are

3
00:00:07.866 --> 00:00:11.544
you? I'm a

4
00:00:11.545 --> 00:00:15.259
dragonfly. Dragonflies are

5
00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:20.921
very fast insects. Where do

6
00:00:20.922 --> 00:00:23.533
you live? Dragonflies live

7
00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:27.528
all over the world. We like

8
00:00:27.529 --> 00:00:30.978
to be near fresh water. We don't

9
00:00:30.979 --> 00:00:35.526
like cold places. Oh.

10
00:00:35.527 --> 00:00:39.117
Do you like warm weather? Yes.

11
00:00:39.118 --> 00:00:43.266
Dragonflies need warm weather. The

12
00:00:43.267 --> 00:00:47.063
sun warms up our wings. Then

13
00:00:47.064 --> 00:00:51.350
we can fly. You

14
00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:54.171
have big eyes! My

15
00:00:54.172 --> 00:00:57.502
eyes cover most of my head. They

16
00:00:57.503 --> 00:01:00.934
let me see all around. That's

17
00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:04.871
how I spot food. What

18
00:01:04.872 --> 00:01:08.234
do you eat? Dragonflies

19
00:01:08.235 --> 00:01:11.823
eat other insects. We

20
00:01:11.824 --> 00:01:16.801
love mosquitoes and gnats. Are

21
00:01:16.802 --> 00:01:20.182
you a good hunter? Yes!

22
00:01:20.183 --> 00:01:24.805
Dragonflies catch prey in the air. We

23
00:01:24.806 --> 00:01:28.059
chase other insects.

24
00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:33.098
Then we catch them with our feet.

25
00:01:33.099 --> 00:01:36.323
Do you have enemies?

26
00:01:36.324 --> 00:01:41.401
Fish, ducks, and big insects try to catch us.

27
00:01:41.402 --> 00:01:46.790
That's why we keep moving.

28
00:01:46.791 --> 00:01:49.101
Here comes a duck.

29
00:01:49.102 --> 00:01:52.499
It's time to fly away.

30
00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:59.439
Good-bye, Dragonfly!

